  "description": "ARC and ISA xlsx compliant parser for experimental metadata toolkit in F#. This project is meant as an easy means to open, manipulate and save ISA (Investigation,Study,Assay) metadata files in isa-xlsx format.",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
