  "published": "2026-10-23T08:11:40.16Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Additions:\nadd isEmpty to CompositeCell and Data, counting blank values as empty (#531, #630)\nadd GetAbsolutePathForWorkflow and GetAbsolutePathForRun to Data (#629)\nadd optional additional contracts to ARC write functions (#622)\nrecover zero-byte entity workbooks when loading an ARC (#620)\nskip .git folders when collecting ARC file paths (#619)\nfail with clear error on duplicate comment names when writing ISA-XLSX (#641)\nadd first version of contributing md\nGroup RO-Crate processes by their own name before the protocol name\nBugfixes:\nfix ISA-JSON import failing on ontology values with empty unit (#640)\nfix dateModified comment being duplicated on RO-Crate read (#642)\nfix TableJoinOptions.Headers join not adding empty cells (#647)\nTest the Int32 boundary of process name suffixes\nKeep the full process name when its number suffix overflows Int32\nMatch process name suffixes exactly and suffix empty tables too\nAlways suffix RO-Crate process names with the row index",
